docs/verification/evidence/testfe001/trace_attack30s.json
# 例外：DEV-RELEASE-001 发布排除——trace gz 含机器指纹（AUD-PUSH-001 S-01），公开仓库不推送
docs/verification/evidence/testfe001/trace_attack30s.json.gz

